# Communications

## Scope (v1)
- Driver inbox (same as app): **All / Updates / Documents** — no Jobs tab in inbox
- Automations config + doc-expiry candidates preview
- Messages (live chat): inbox + operator reply + close/reopen ticket (`live_chat_*`)
- Nav badge = unread driver messages on active sessions
- **No** SMS/WhatsApp inbox in this module yet (`comms_*` stays separate)

## Single source of truth
- Full history (all driver-related events + delivery status): `admin_communications_send_history_v1`
- Driver inbox mirror: `admin_driver_inbox_feed_v1`
- Doc expiry candidates: `admin_doc_expiry_candidates_v1`
- Messages inbox: `admin_driver_help_sessions_v1` (includes `unread_count`)
- Messages / reply / close: `live_chat_sessions` + `live_chat_messages` (`sender_type=operator`)
- Automation toggles: `notification_automation_rules`
- Driver picker: `admin_drivers_list_v4`
- Writes for send: RPC `admin_enqueue_driver_notification(p_type, …)`
  (ledger → `notification_events` + inbox type → `enqueue_driver_inbox_message`)

## Inbox sections (match driver NotificationsScreen)
- **Updates**: `admin_message` | `app_update` | `announcement` | `system` | account_*
- **Documents**: `document_approved` | `document_rejected` | `document_expired` | `document_required`
- Jobs stay push/Jobs screen; Help stays Support/chat — not inbox tabs

## Rules
- Do not invent notification rows in React; read views
- Org-scoped via `getCurrentOrg`
- Secrets stay in env; no tokens in client
- Prefer reusable `PageHeader`, `Button`, `Select`, `Badge`, toasts
- Realtime: subscribe to `notifications` / `live_chat_*`, then refetch SSOT APIs
- Send UI must show destination: Driver app → Notifications → Updates|Documents
